PICTURE
Engraving engine (engine/): copied from the library's engraving demo (MIT). All drawings, lettering layout and animation in film.js are original.
Her video: Takshila's own footage.

MUSIC (mix.py, original composition, G major, 84 bpm)
Harpsichord (VCSL), pizzicato and bowed strings (VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition), both CC0 1.0, Versilian Studios.

SOUND EFFECTS
Synthesised in mix.py with numpy and the library's core/audio/sfx.py: burin hiss, letter ticks, circular scribe, burnishing,
pen scratch, water drops, tissue rustle, paper peel, press thump, room tone.

